{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"1a8eb720dcd2b3d31486c62f75b95b64cda809b640bc14a8b1f3c8b4d777c878","ja":"それぞれの接客","zh":"各自的接待能力","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"02116792c6c10cd850dabebb1c147d95656b7ce9904daefb82c58b60c35e6a48","ja":"（私ももっと、頑張らないと……）","zh":"（我也得多加把劲才行……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6e2a5bc03afd5f1a6caaff58a7e9b69bf867cf768b00e188f3856e2a13b923c1","ja":"「あの、すみません。\nちょっと、お聞きしたいことが……」","zh":"“那个，打扰一下。\n我想请问一点事情……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"383068999416760fd3faeb0874866bc5c0045a09219e2f98010d8eb750216b06","ja":"えっ、お子さんがアレルギー……。\n少々お待ちください。","zh":"哎，您的孩子过敏了……\n请稍等片刻。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"8246275df459ef1938f7c42fb539bbc7269847fad02c17301b58a22f663218ce","ja":"お待たせしました。原材料を確認したのですが、\n問題ありませんでした。","zh":"让您久等了。我们确认了一下原材料，\n没有发现问题。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"c5bd8b1b51ebb8bb90afe0a687c13f236685f7bbdbefa28e42678933c99f0f53","ja":"「わざわざありがとうございます！\nでは、こちらをいただけますか」","zh":"「特意跑一趟真是太感谢了！\n那么，能请您收下这个吗」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"dc157aafe5a49b5806fccf269e83969f9c848a82f1757b7c9eb5a52e0e730c58","ja":"はい、どうぞ。\nありがとうございました。","zh":"好的，请拿好。\n非常感谢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"087b200c7cd788f4a395123c04d71f0fabd0882fbd25c9331976c0e0ba6904ee","ja":"……先ほどのお客様、とても喜んでいましたわね。\n千早の丁寧な接客、お見事でしたわ。","zh":"……刚才那位客人，看起来非常高兴呢。\n千早周到的招待，真是太出色了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"b2e77c8481a5d55bf2ec78c5dd3b7037f43b48732380ea78b172bc7afb62ad4b","ja":"えっ……そう、ですか？","zh":"咦……是、这样吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"95f3cc06012e28bb3a2b40b7b9cb5383fd33ba899e25a6c1a181b445b97a9b4b","ja":"ええ。わからないことはすぐに確認して、\nしっかり商品の説明をして……素晴らしいですわ！","zh":"是的。遇到不明白的事情马上就去确认，\n还能好好地介绍商品……真是太出色了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"12609fff02c80732bb5603c8a45c8b5accd6637b1b273b698bc01e8a0842c100","ja":"ロコもチハヤのまっすぐさは、\nカスタマーサービスにぴったりだと思いました！","zh":"ROCO也觉得千早的直率，\n非常适合客服工作！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"9533bea161e17408135499ea498e28b38ea503ee680fb2cd09cc873adba0157c","ja":"……よかった。\n私なりに、最後まで頑張ってみます。","zh":"……太好了。\n我会按自己的步调，坚持努力到最后的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"db3863fa9299f271cbfb74f37a90d621a7721d57a7e789e53f4979d0a3e0590c","ja":"そして1時間後……","zh":"然后过了1小时……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1e01248d7bd9787278894cd38a824aaf50a947afcd0b1ff44710f52b11183618","ja":"ありがとうございました！\n……今のお客様でラストですわ！","zh":"非常感谢您！\n……刚才那位就是最后一位客人了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"1f2cffc8849a0cec9b097b50577bfde6c79412621f280b922602baf889aecdf3","ja":"ミッションコンプリートですね！\nラッピングをみんなに見てもらえてハッピーでした♪","zh":"任务全部完成了呢！\n彩绘能让大家看到，真是太开心了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"6de39e88772350dae474c0ee81d80ff43adc9a8bab6c9b4b7d03ae6dd0ce9ad1","ja":"「本当にありがとうございました！\nよければ、お礼にうちの他の菓子をどうぞ……！」","zh":"「真的非常感谢您！\n不嫌弃的话，请收下我们店里的其他点心当作谢礼吧……！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"8296f092b97af8cdecd8a07e42b87272d25ea7bd56b3ec87f55b2df10e68b148","ja":"こんなにいいんですか？\nありがとうございます。","zh":"可以拿这么多吗？\n非常感谢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e3cad6dddae96dc16941a9055f30e02440401d7dbb4a0de937152edc04f31203","ja":"千早、コロちゃん、お店の方々。\nそしてスタッフのみなさま方。大変お疲れ様でした♪","zh":"千早、小可洛、店里的各位。\n还有工作人员各位。大家都辛苦了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1719.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"0310cb2e8eadd8213710103c64d393f163f63b392932d4ba734ab9a5b9582584","ja":"（ドラマのような、セレブな振る舞いはできなかった\nですが……こちらの方が良かったですわね！）","zh":"（虽然没能像电视剧里那样展现出名媛举止\n……不过这样反而更棒呢！）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:34:52+00:00"}
